title: "Armed conflict and reported disease outbreaks: a global country-year analysis — replication code"
abstract: "Replication code building a balanced country-year panel (236 countries/territories, 1996–2024) linking WHO Disease Outbreak News to the UCDP/PRIO Armed Conflict Dataset v25.1, with within-country fixed-effects models of conflict and reported outbreaks."
